WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.503
Everywhere Roxy looked she saw blobs.

2
00:00:07.504 --> 00:00:09.087
They oozed on buildings.

3
00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:11.865
They covered cars.

4
00:00:11.866 --> 00:00:14.855
"This is terrible!" thought Roxy.

5
00:00:14.856 --> 00:00:18.928
A helicopter flew over Mara.

6
00:00:18.929 --> 00:00:21.706
One small blob jumped toward it.

7
00:00:21.707 --> 00:00:26.448
But the blob froze and fell to the rooftop.

8
00:00:26.449 --> 00:00:28.781
"Wow!" said Mara.

9
00:00:28.782 --> 00:00:35.528
"I think the cold breeze from the helicopter froze that blob!"

10
00:00:35.529 --> 00:00:38.188
Mara looked at Roxy.

11
00:00:38.189 --> 00:00:40.736
"Rocket Girl!" she called.

12
00:00:40.737 --> 00:00:43.152
"Use your super breath!

13
00:00:43.153 --> 00:00:46.150
It will freeze the blobs!"

14
00:00:46.151 --> 00:00:49.007
"I'll try it!" Roxy called back.

15
00:00:49.008 --> 00:00:52.828
Roxy took a deep breath. Whoosh!

16
00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:56.679
Three blobs on a billboard froze and fell to the street.

17
00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:59.171
"Yes!" Roxy cheered.

18
00:00:59.172 --> 00:01:01.879
She took a deeper breath and blew again.

19
00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:06.135
Whoo-ooo-oosh! More blobs froze.

20
00:01:06.136 --> 00:01:11.694
Soon every blob was frozen solid.

21
00:01:11.695 --> 00:01:14.947
Mrs. Wiggles was in her candy factory.

22
00:01:14.948 --> 00:01:19.098
"Soon I'll call Mayor Bloom," she said.

23
00:01:19.099 --> 00:01:24.845
"I'll tell him to pay me one million dollars!"

24
00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:29.734
Mrs. Wiggles peered through a telescope at downtown Metro City.

25
00:01:29.735 --> 00:01:32.893
"Oh no!" she cried.

26
00:01:32.894 --> 00:01:36.363
"Where did my bubble gum blob go?"

27
00:01:36.364 --> 00:01:40.083
Just then Roxy crashed into the candy factory.

28
00:01:40.084 --> 00:01:43.843
"Rocket Girl!" said Mrs. Wiggles.

29
00:01:43.844 --> 00:01:47.588
"I stopped your bubble gum blob!" said Roxy.

30
00:01:47.589 --> 00:01:50.604
"And now you're going to jail!"

31
00:01:50.605 --> 00:01:53.362
Mrs. Wiggles snapped her fingers.

32
00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:56.581
Several large gingerbread men ran into the room.

33
00:01:56.582 --> 00:02:00.238
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

34
00:02:00.239 --> 00:02:03.506
"You'll never take me to jail!"

35
00:02:03.507 --> 00:02:06.001
Roxy looked at the gingerbread men.

36
00:02:06.002 --> 00:02:08.706
They were big and mean looking.

37
00:02:08.707 --> 00:02:11.398
"I'll be right back," said Roxy.

38
00:02:11.399 --> 00:02:13.736
"I forgot something."

39
00:02:13.737 --> 00:02:16.203
Roxy flew out of the building.

40
00:02:16.204 --> 00:02:18.532
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

41
00:02:18.533 --> 00:02:21.283
"Rocket Girl is scared of—"

42
00:02:21.284 --> 00:02:25.756
Splat! A small blob hit a gingerbread man.

43
00:02:25.757 --> 00:02:29.329
The gingerbread man smashed into pieces.

44
00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:33.055
"What's going on?" Mrs. Wiggles cried.

45
00:02:33.056 --> 00:02:37.006
Splat! Splat! Splat!

46
00:02:37.007 --> 00:02:41.852
Roxy threw blobs at every gingerbread man.

47
00:02:41.853 --> 00:02:45.058
Soon all the gingerbread men were smashed.

48
00:02:45.059 --> 00:02:49.148
"No!" cried Mrs. Wiggles.

49
00:02:49.149 --> 00:02:52.817
Roxy took Mrs. Wiggles to jail.

50
00:02:52.818 --> 00:02:55.725
Then she flew back to Mara.

51
00:02:55.726 --> 00:02:58.665
"Thanks for your help," said Roxy.

52
00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:02.321
"My friends are at Metro City Park," said Mara.

53
00:03:02.322 --> 00:03:04.241
"Can you take me there?"

54
00:03:04.242 --> 00:03:11.202
Roxy smiled. "Sure. Rocket Girl can do that!"

55
00:03:11.203 --> 00:03:15.264
A little while later, Roxy was out of her Rocket Girl costume.

56
00:03:15.265 --> 00:03:19.140
She found her friends at the park.

57
00:03:19.141 --> 00:03:23.508
"Hey, Roxy!" called Terrell."Mara is here!

58
00:03:23.509 --> 00:03:25.524
Guess who found her."

59
00:03:25.525 --> 00:03:27.934
"Who?" asked Roxy.

60
00:03:27.935 --> 00:03:30.332
"Rocket Girl!" said Mara.

61
00:03:30.333 --> 00:03:34.309
"She saved me from a giant bubble gum blob!"

62
00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.151
"Wow," said Roxy.

63
00:03:37.152 --> 00:03:41.169
"I can't believe I missed Rocket Girl."

64
00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:44.237
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

65
00:03:44.238 --> 00:03:51.219
"Let's play kickball!" said Jack.

66
00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:59.755
Roxy and her friends ran onto the field.

